# Risk-Aware Civic Issue Management System

## Description
A web-based system that allows citizens to report civic issues with image evidence and risk levels.
The system dynamically escalates unresolved issues based on time thresholds to ensure faster resolution.

## Core Features
- Citizen and Admin roles
- Issue reporting with image upload
- User-defined risk levels
- Dynamic risk escalation (24h / 12h / 6h)
- Priority-based admin dashboard

## Technology Stack
- Frontend: React
- Backend: Flask / FastAPI
- Database: PostgreSQL
- Storage: Supabase

